{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_382F40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"坏消息……。\n我们的Boss落入敌手了。\n不过我相信Boss一定能靠自己逃出来。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"问题是被敌人夺走的装备。\n不把这些拿回来，就算是Boss恐怕也很难逃脱。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"所以，我要你潜入采掘场伪装基地的地下通道，\n把Snake的装备全部回收回来。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我知道你想直接救出Boss。\n但现在要相信Boss，专心做好支援。\n我会看着你的表现。拜托了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":""}]}